<description>&lt;p&gt;Thailand is expanding border security with police chiefs ordering tighter controls and the air force scrambling F-16s to intercept unidentified aircraft near the Tak border, while Thailand and Myanmar have agreed to joint water-quality monitoring of border rivers and six monitoring stations to address arsenic from Shan State mines. CP All will close all 7-Eleven stores in Cambodia, and Thais have donated 269 million baht for a Thai-Cambodian border fence and shelters. A Chanthaburi man confessed to an acid attack on his wife and a father and son were jailed for smuggling about £500,000 of cannabis. 35 battle-related deaths were recorded in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinwFBVV95cUxNcUpsRzU0UGYxVkZCSEoxZEswM1VjdHJqYWRtNFlIdHBUSy1XWVdXeXV6d3hFYktIR3Z0VGtPeW5YSkYwZDhoallmLUVnbjVBeW5jSnZwb2plU2tEQjNSX1hBbGxoc0FtVVotRVlubDR0YVNRTzUyMGRqWEFsMWNJT0RYXzRwNWxyWXpvdnVHeWpZU05oZWJfc0pUZEE2cU0?oc=5&quot;&gt;Nikkei Asia&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuwFBVV95cUxPYnZEZlFSbWxLTUs1UE0xdlkzc2ZDcVRpOUVOY1c1QTk0OTlNbzNJV25KWXZjNVdnRzZ3M19HMWNRaXl4aTlTb29GOWQwNlJONTZGcGxyOEJNZ2dDa3MydXlHSU1EOHdINmNVQ09FdGZrbXk0MWNCZzRQaFhSbU9TOFRlc2ZxUXJjNkxKdXh4Q0Z3WUVyWlAxRktOd0xPVzFLd1BsR0FGbGlBSnpDcFM1bnJISHFwVkE3S0xV?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Star&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqAFBVV95cUxOcVM4REk0SlJqTGhWend1OHI2eTVSbmZ5Q1V0dUhzQUtjMF9laE05VTFrNjNfbEpyb0dydlJCVnZLa0o3Njd4SW4zbjJIcWZFWXN4ZGd6QVNwdXdYRDAwQkRqOXB1Sy1JVTB1U1BaRWttb3RSMl9XdHhIWDl2MHQtVnJqZVdDV3hIT1BmczhBelQ5RWZxZVBrczBLNHZicjhXeUNSUXpjTTg?oc=5&quot;&gt;Khmer Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiWEFVX3lxTFA4MnNpNFBaUlJkaDZvVldVWlBEU3lxUjJaa2xCVUZ4YzlncjU0SVhvOG1CU3dsb3ZLSFgtMFVEd3B2d2sxZVBlSjRVU1ltWkhlaVlVWU4xd1k?oc=5&qu